      "cooked": "<p>Some created examples of what I mean</p><div>eg &nbsp;La Capitan - Siege-Breaker has 1hp left and Silver Gulch - Explosives Wagon is in play. &nbsp;Siege-breaker can hit two targets. The first hero target selected is Unity - Cryo Bot. Cryo Bot is dealt damage. It therefore deals each non-hero 1 cold damage (+1 explosives wagon). Siege-breaker is destroyed (1 + 1 -1 damage). Does the attack on a second hero by Siege Breaker still go ahead or is it cancelled ?&nbsp;</div><div>eg Omnitron-X - Gaussian Coil Blaster deals 3 targets x 1 lightening damage. This is increased to 3 damage by Explosive Wagon and Water Trough. The first of the targets is Water trough which is destroyed. Is the damage against the two remaining targets 2 or 3 each</div>",
