      "created_at": "2013-12-17T19:00:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, destroying CryoBot stops it's damage as it's no longer around to deal it, in the same way that destroyign Citizen Hammer half-way through his damage run will stop him dealing any more.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Similarly, in your second example, the sdamge O-X will do will be 2 (Base +1 for explosives wagon as the water trough will not longer be around to add its bonus)</p>",
